{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_amgoat_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_amgoat_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "學者之心",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_amgoat_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2335c3ab12dcc7259ca75e772795290dcfd045251f1f2870d94c4a9ac3dd1917",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可以開始了嗎？錄音鍵好像閃了一下，不知道是不是錯覺......嗯......摸起來慢慢變熱了......大概在工作了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，那個......今天是外勤的第三天，我們成功抵達了目標地塊附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在是上午十點三十......呃，這個數字是一嗎？抱歉，我看不太清......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......變、變成二了！現在是十點三十二分，距離羅德島抵達會合點還有......嗯，還有十二小時二十八分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到目前為止都很順利，檢測符文在來的路上已經準備好啦，採樣設備的話，大家正在幫我安裝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......欸，什麼？似乎聽見有人叫我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊，錄音器差點掉地上。呼......呼，不能著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是在對我揮手？看這個手勢的意思，是都安裝好了嗎？數據採集開始......同步分析啟動......好，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是......是巴蒂先生吧？助聽器......好的，助聽器沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，別著急！走慢些，小心腳下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒關係的......巴蒂先生，您可以不用扶著我。這裡視野很開闊呢，也不用擔心我不小心撞到東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣嗎？但是風很大，而且到處都是凹凸不平的石塊，艾雅法拉小姐的話，還是留在飛行器那邊比較好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟出來的時候，我可是拿下個月的薪水向凱爾希醫生他們保證了哦，一定會確保你的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沙拉？和......凱爾希醫生一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？是說薪水啦，薪水！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我可不敢和凱爾希醫生一起吃沙拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是、是這樣嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......我的助聽器......可能是剛才風太大了，還是受了一點影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，您剛剛是在說自己的工作吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴蒂先生十分可靠呢。這趟出來多虧了巴蒂先生，如果只有我一個人的話，光是安裝那些設備，就要花掉一整個下午。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒，一個人？這麼重的設備，你一個人......還是太困難了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前也有過啦。還在學校的時候，有一些研究需要一個人完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，同學們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......那個，大家的進度不太一樣......那些課題的話，確實還是需要一些經驗的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呦，說著說著就忘了，艾雅法拉小姐已經是個很厲害的學者，其他同學恐怕跟不上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的話，在學校還是太辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實還好啦......沒、沒關係的，一個人的話，慢慢地總能做好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過哦，來羅德島以後，無論是在船上還是偶爾出外勤，確實做什麼都方便很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新的助聽器比之前的都要好用，凱爾希醫生和前輩很支持我的研究，可露希爾小姐還幫忙改造了我的宿舍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像巴蒂先生一樣，幹員們總是在很溫柔地照顧著我。嗯......真的很感謝大家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一路上被艾雅法拉小姐感謝了好多次，哎呀，真是越來越不好意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！前面也踩好點了，能走，就是路挺窄，你們這大玩意兒啊，過不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......最後一個採樣點，是說沒辦法過去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人可以走。可——以——走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，也不用這麼大聲吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是看她呆呆的，老是耳朵不大靈光的樣子嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......我現在聽到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，巴蒂先生，我們現在就過去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，等等，你也要過去？我說人可以走，但你這樣的，還是算了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面的路可不好走。這附近總地震，到處坑坑窪窪，一不留神就會一腳踩進坑裡。要不是你們給的錢多，連我都不願意到這來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你啊，你這平地走起來都不流暢，還非要去湊熱鬧，這不是純粹添亂嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你怎麼能這麼說艾雅法拉小姐？別看她年紀小，她可是最頂尖的火山學家！這次任務我們可都是聽她指揮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才不管這個學家那個學家，前頭的路就是要靠兩條腿過去才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃說得也......那個，艾雅法拉小姐......他有句話說得沒錯，如果前面的路真的不好走，你要不然還是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，巴蒂先生，嚮導先生......給你們添麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我必須去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是擔心設備的話，我都可以幫你安裝好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我知道，巴蒂先生說得沒錯。可前面就是這附近源石反應異常帶的中心，必須使用更高精度的檢測手段，這需要用上我的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，要不然就用附近這些採樣點的數據？也不少了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行哦巴蒂先生。想要得到最確切的結果，就不能放過每一處細節。如果我在這裡偷懶的話，我們這趟任務，可能都會功虧一簣呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉小姐突然變得好嚴肅......既然這樣的話，那就只能出發了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過事先說好哦，假如艾雅法拉小姐覺得很難受的話，我們需要隨時停下來。就像做研究是艾雅法拉小姐的工作一樣，這也是我的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我可以的，巴蒂先生不用擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。怎麼看都是在勉強自己啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，實話你們不愛聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可說好了，萬一出了點什麼事，我只管我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎你這人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，沒關係。嚮導先生，麻煩您帶路吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錄音繼續......現在是中午十二點二十五分，我們正在往最後一個採樣點前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後方採樣點的數據正在持續分析中......唔，和我預測的比較接近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然是古火山留下的火成岩，可深層的源石活性依然強烈，繼續強化的趨勢也......很明顯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關鍵在異常帶的核心......有了這部分數據，就可以分析變化方向......希望不會影響羅德島後面的任——哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍、稍微撞了一下肩膀......抱歉巴蒂先生......是我沒看清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還好嗎？我們已經走了一個小時了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......嗯......我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "風很大，比剛才更大了。和我們一樣，正在往石頭縫裡鑽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......是很冷......腿有些酸......眼睛也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我，我可以的。請繼續往前走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，果然無論如何都不願意停下來呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，艾雅法拉小姐還是往我身後站一些，我個子大，能擋著風，有石頭的話我也會先避開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......好的。謝謝巴蒂先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，我可早就說過了，這條路會很難走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以說，到底前面有什麼寶貝，值得你們非要走一趟啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行動目的不是在找你的時候就已經交待過了嗎？我們是羅德島，一家醫藥企業，來這裡是為了調查研究——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，場面話就不用再重複了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼調查，什麼研究？最後不都還是衝著錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，尤其是你們這些藥企，從那些拼命想活下來的有錢老爺們兜裡撈了不少錢吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......唉，說了你也不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要賺錢沒錯，可有些事不是錢可以衡量的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？不是為了賺錢？我就說......為了賺錢幹啥來這裡挖石頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟，我想起來了，有些人，那些貴族老爺的手下，他們總愛擺弄些什麼法術，什麼實驗，什麼研究......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可真是——不得了，不得了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂你，你擺出這麼一副害怕的樣子是做什麼？都說了我們不是那種人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......好大的石頭啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的頭，我的頭......咦，我的頭還在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才那塊石頭不是衝著我的腦袋飛過來的？我還以為我的腦袋已經被砸扁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟，這紅紅的！還有地上的碎片，在咕咕冒泡......是岩漿？火山？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山噴發了嗎？！救、救命啊！我要死啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住嘴——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於說出來了，忍了我好久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉小姐......艾雅法拉小姐？你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴蒂先生是在找我嗎？我在這裡，我很好。剛剛那塊落石，有沒有傷到你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是沒有，我看到的時候也以為晚了——等等，打掉石頭的是艾雅法拉小姐的法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你們沒事就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......連我都沒有反應過來，你明明耳朵和眼睛都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴蒂先生說得沒錯，我剛剛並沒有聽見什麼，也只模模糊糊看到了一點影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我能感覺到......熱量的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚮導先生也提到了，這邊的石頭結構並不穩固。受到大風外力影響，岩層發生斷裂的時候，斷層與岩體本身的摩擦會產生明顯的熱量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，居然是這樣！艾雅法拉小姐......你可真是太厲害了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的......厲害，而且好嚇人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就那一下，就那一下！那麼大一塊石頭，就這麼變成了熔化了的碎片！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天呐，如果那一下是衝著我腦袋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，我閉嘴了，嗯，閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，終於到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在是......啊，比計畫中稍微晚了十五分鐘。得抓緊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "設備開始啟動......精度還需要提升百分之十五......頻率控制，穩定波動值......嗯......百分之九......百分之三......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，雜訊已落到理想區間。巴蒂先生，你可以鬆手啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......這也是法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，這確實也是我的源石技藝......嚮導先生可以認為這是法術，不過我更喜歡把這稱作一種科學研究手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是好厲害啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚮導先生也累了吧？現在我們可以到上面去稍微休息一下。樣本採集還需要時間，等五個小時後再來回收設備就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科學家......科學家。看起來年紀小，說起這些話來還真是像模像樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，剛才那一下，你到底還是救了我。我也不是那種分不清好歹的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚮導",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，之前說好的嚮導費，預付的部分我收下了，剩下的錢不用給了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，都跟你說過多少回了，我們羅德島真不圖那點錢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......那個，巴蒂先生......要是嚮導先生堅持的話，那我們就收下他的感謝吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？這、這樣嗎......既然艾雅法拉小姐這麼說，那當然也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）就是我多多少少有些意外吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴蒂先生說什麼？抱歉我又沒聽清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，沒什麼。我是說，真沒想到艾雅法拉小姐還懂這些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？其實......雖然這麼說有些不好意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像，並沒有完全聽明白嚮導先生在說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之就是......那個，我的助聽器還是時靈時不靈的......我是看嚮導先生真的一臉誠懇，而且好像是在說著感謝的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我難道又弄錯了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒也沒有......哈哈哈......艾雅法拉小姐，大概這就是真正的厲害學者吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員巴蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能無視那些表面功夫，一眼洞穿真諦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚......好，好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在是下午三點十四分，數據採集和分析正在穩步推進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在剛才前往最後一個採樣點的路程中發生了一點小小的意外，當然，並沒有影響具體工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......路上和嚮導先生還有巴蒂先生發生了一些有趣的對話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然不確定有沒有完全理解他們的意思，但好像巴蒂先生說我、我是真正的學者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，我很不好意思......並且想起了走之前的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可以哦！艾雅法拉小姐這個身體情況，絕對不允許再出外勤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可，可是......那個源石礦異常信號有很大機率和火山有關，而且剛好在羅德島接下來行進路線的周邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是站在火山學者、還是羅德島幹員的立場上，我都有必要去完成這次實地檢測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的身體......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請相信我，我可以照顧好自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓她去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒？錫蘭小姐，你也是我們醫療部的一員啊！你怎麼會支持病人這麼胡來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就當是胡來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我多多少少也算是個研究者，因此大致能理解艾雅法拉小姐的心情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果說——我是說如果，有一個機會能讓我對源石的瞭解多一些——我也一定會奮不顧身的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。我是擔心，萬一這次任務讓艾雅法拉小姐的病情進一步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以才更想去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時間不多了，而真相依然很遠——所以才更加迫切地抓緊每一個機會、每一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......趁我還可以......我的雙腿還可以支撐著行走。我的雙眼......也還能看見那些光亮......火山的光亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，那些光......我這樣的半吊子，還看不到這些，可我知道艾雅法拉小姐能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像艾雅法拉小姐這樣的學者，早就已經站在整個世界認知的邊界線上。她能往前一點點，我們就也能跟著往前一點點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往前未必是好事，可能會恐懼，會跌倒。但要我因為擔憂受傷而阻止艾雅法拉小姐繼續前行，我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這些學者啊......唉，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算啦。艾雅法拉小姐這麼堅持的話，我也不會再阻攔。請向凱爾希醫生提出申請吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......謝謝。謝謝你，也謝謝錫蘭小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候，也說到了類似的話題呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科學家，學者......是什麼樣子的呢？我好像很少會想到這方面的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錫蘭小姐說得沒錯，我只是想趁自己還有時間，努力地離火山、還有這片大地最深處的奧秘再近一點點而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要說真正的學者，小時候我心裡會浮現出爸爸媽媽的樣子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而現在的話，還多了另一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，這個問題的答案，等我回來你可以告訴我嗎——前輩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
